      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The issue with this is fall-backs are intended to be used in case of an avatar ither corrupted download or is higher than the set user minimum performance rank, at the moment people can set this worst rank to good if they want every frame they can. If fall-backs where set to medium as the limit these users who want every frame would go back to robot hell as people flex the limitations.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
