  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-12-31T00:44:44.518Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It's really strange to have a Quest Medium-ranked \"Quest version\" of your PC avatar but be unable to use it for Quest fallback.\n\n10K is really challenging to hit as a target for Quest. Excellent PC avatars can start with potentially 3 times the target (up to 32k).\n\nQuest Medium would make more sense as a target for Quest fallbacks.\n\nYes, there's an element of \"get good at retopo, nerd\", but currently I can upload a PC avatar with a Quest Medium version on the same ID, but I can't use that same Quest Medium avatar as a fallback.",
